Self-host license notice:
The Nitsor control plane and data plane are source-available under FSL, not open source. The bundled Convex backend is FSL-1.1-ALv2,
which is source-available but not OSI-approved open source for the running release.
The per-release Apache conversion never reaches the version you are running and is not a mitigation.

